  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05SV">Definition <span data-tag="05SV">13.14.9</span>.</a> In Situation <a href="/tag/05S8" data-tag="05S8">13.14.1</a>. We say $F$ is <em>right derivable</em>, or that $RF$ <em>everywhere defined</em> if $RF$ is defined at every object of $\mathcal{D}$. We say $F$ is <em>left derivable</em>, or that $LF$ <em>everywhere defined</em> if $LF$ is defined at every object of $\mathcal{D}$. </p>
